# Eval dataset. Expected outputs encode the documented product policy in
# DESIGN.md (precision-first, restraint on weak evidence) - they were not
# copied from observed system outputs. Constructed cases were written from
# the design; harvested cases were added from real Kivi dictation after the
# build, including honest misses the system is required NOT to guess at.
# Schema per case: id, category, seed ("persona" | [events]), steps[], and
# optionally requires_llm (skip without a key) / mode ("no-llm" forces the
# deterministic path). Step kinds: run (expect_output / expect_output_any /
# expect_decisions {text: code-prefix} / expect_no_llm), observe
# (expect_learned / expect_confirmed / expect_reverted / expect_ignored),
# add, delete, assert_term (status), assert_absent.
# Seed persona state: Kivi+Sarvam trusted (explicit), Aaditya trusted (learned
# 2x), Shreyaa watching (learned 1x), Advaith muted (force-disabled).

